msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-pasts"

msgid "your@email.com"
msgstr "tavs@epasts.lv"

msgid "Subscribe"
msgstr "Pieteikties"

msgid "You are now subscribed!"
msgstr "Tu esi pieteicies jaunumiem!"

msgid "Verification failed. Please try again."
msgstr "Pārbaude neizdevās. Lūdzu, mēģini vēlreiz."

msgid "Invalid email address."
msgstr "Nederīga e-pasta adrese."

msgid "Check your inbox to confirm your subscription."
msgstr "Pārbaudi savu e-pastu, lai apstiprinātu pieteikšanos."

msgid "Confirm your subscription to %s"
msgstr "Apstiprini pieteikšanos jaunumiem — %s"

msgid "Hi,\n\nClick the link below to confirm your re-subscription:\n\n%s\n\nIf you did not request this, please ignore this email."
msgstr "Sveiks!\n\nSpied saiti zemāk, lai apstiprinātu atkārtotu pieteikšanos:\n\n%s\n\nJa tu to nepieprasīji, šo e-pastu vari ignorēt."

msgid "Summary for the %s"
msgstr "%s apskats"

msgid "This is our montly report to you, hoepfully you will find something usefull"
msgstr "Šis ir mūsu ikmēneša apskats — ceram, ka atradīsi ko noderīgu."

msgid "Check Out Our Latest Articles!"
msgstr "Apskati mūsu jaunākos rakstus!"

msgid "Discover newest articles and printables for parents and kids."
msgstr "Atklāj jaunākos rakstus un drukājamos uzdevumus vecākiem un bērniem."

msgid "Thank you for reading!"
msgstr "Paldies, ka lasi!"

msgid "We hope you enjoyed our monthly newsletter. If you have any questions or suggestions, feel free to contact us."
msgstr "Ceram, ka mūsu ikmēneša jaunumi tev patika. Ja tev ir jautājumi vai ieteikumi, raksti mums."

msgid "Something went wrong. Please try again."
msgstr "Kaut kas nogāja greizi. Lūdzu, mēģini vēlreiz."

msgid "Unsubscribe"
msgstr "Atteikties"

msgid "You have been successfully re-subscribed. Welcome back!"
msgstr "Tu esi veiksmīgi pieteicies atkārtoti. Prieks tevi atkal redzēt!"

msgid "Back to home"
msgstr "Atpakaļ uz sākumu"

msgid "This confirmation link is invalid or has already been used."
msgstr "Šī apstiprinājuma saite ir nederīga vai jau izmantota."

msgid "Unsubscribed already!"
msgstr "Jau atteicies!"

msgid "Looks, like you already are unsubscribed."
msgstr "Izskatās, ka esi jau atteicies no jaunumiem."

msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "Vai tiešām?"

msgid "Are you sure that you want to unsubscribe?"
msgstr "Vai tiešām vēlies atteikties no jaunumiem?"

msgid "Help us to get better"
msgstr "Palīdzi mums kļūt labākiem"

msgid "We are sad to see you go, but could you provide us feedback? We want to get better. Your opinion is highly valuable to us."
msgstr "Mums ir žēl tevi zaudēt, bet varbūt vari pateikt, kāpēc? Mēs gribam kļūt labāki, un tavs viedoklis mums ir ļoti svarīgs."

msgid "Let us know what we can improve"
msgstr "Pastāsti, ko varam uzlabot"

msgid "Could not unsubscribe you!"
msgstr "Neizdevās tevi atteikt!"

msgid "We could not find you in subscribers list."
msgstr "Neatradām tevi jaunumu saņēmēju sarakstā."

msgid "You have been unsubscribed!"
msgstr "Tu esi atteicies no jaunumiem!"

msgid "We hate to see you go. But thanks for being with us. And good luck!"
msgstr "Mums žēl, ka aizej. Paldies, ka biji kopā ar mums, un veiksmi!"
